This repository contains two categories of content under different licenses:

## Article content (GFDL-1.3-or-later)

Articles imported from ApoWiki (https://apowiki.fi) are licensed under the
GNU Free Documentation License 1.3 or later (GFDL-1.3-or-later), as they are
in the source wiki. The faithful-history import preserves the original
contributor attribution: every commit that adds or changes ApoWiki-sourced
content is authored by the real ApoWiki contributor on the real edit date,
citing the MediaWiki revision id (oldid) in the commit message.

Bare IP-address authors from early ApoWiki revisions are pseudonymized to
"ApoWiki-anonymous" at import, with the real IP kept only in a local,
gitignored provenance sidecar — this protects personal data under GDPR
while preserving GFDL's authorship-attribution requirement.

The full GFDL text: https://www.gnu.org/copyleft/fdl.html

